<title>USA: Diatide names Daniel Harrington CFO.</title>
<headline>Diatide names Daniel Harrington CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDONDERRY, N.H. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diatide Inc Tuesday said Daniel Harrington has been named chief financial officer of the pharmaceutical company, replacing Mark Attarian.</p>
<p>Harrington joins Diatide from GenRad Inc, where he was the CFO.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
